<title>Department of the Army, Headquarters XVIII Airborne Corps and Fort Bragg, Fort Bragg, North Carolina
and Local R5-160, National Association of Government Employees, Service Employees International Union,
AFL-CIO, Case No. 96 FSIP 19 FLRAfsip</title>
</head>

<body>

<p ALIGN="CENTER">&nbsp;</p>
<p ALIGN="CENTER">United States of America</p>
<p ALIGN="CENTER">BEFORE THE FEDERAL SERVICE IMPASSES PANEL</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<table BORDER="1" CELLSPACING="1" CELLPADDING="8" WIDTH="624">
